        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/dbafc6eb42da48c06fa10a02d0bb445c.poster.avif?t=1788623006\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/dbafc6eb42da48c06fa10a02d0bb445c.webm?t=1788623006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You shouldn’t be here. But now that you are… leaving won’t be so easy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>Dr. John Ravenwood was once a lawyer, until the day he lost his daughter. From that moment the happy life of the Ravenwood family turned into a nightmare. His wife blamed him and left the house, and he was left alone with his mother, who slowly began to lose her mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now you have stepped into his manor, and he will not let you go until you play his little game, just like the others before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Anomalies </strong>- Spot the Unseen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/2466ab07b0c55ed50fd2287973d399ac.poster.avif?t=1788623006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/2466ab07b0c55ed50fd2287973d399ac.webm?t=1788623006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The manor holds many rooms, each a little different. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every corner hides a secret, and time bends and twists inside these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you enter one of his events, the <strong>clock</strong> starts ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> You are trapped in a loop, and now you have to spot the <strong>anomalies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">John Ravenwood is always watching, waiting for you to make your <strong>decision</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Contract - </strong>Ravenwood’s Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/de97f7112340bab16d17cfbeb420e3c5.poster.avif?t=1788623006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/de97f7112340bab16d17cfbeb420e3c5.webm?t=1788623006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spotting the anomalies is only the first step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To survive, you must make the right choice by signing the correct phrase in his <strong>contract</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have to play his game by his rules each round, and every signature matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One mistake</strong> is enough… and the consequences will be unavoidable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Punishment</strong> - Facing His Wrath </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3d597d6c4a668aeb50acc0e014652c92.poster.avif?t=1788623006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3d597d6c4a668aeb50acc0e014652c92.webm?t=1788623006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you fail to complete the contract, or if time runs out, <strong>John</strong> will send his mother after you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mama</strong> is silent, fast, and merciless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can try to <strong>run</strong>, you can try to <strong>hide</strong>, <br>but this is <strong>punishment</strong>, and only your luck can save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Rules Are Simple</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 <strong>Find the Anomalies</strong> – Each room hides a paranormal disturbance… or does it?<br>🔹 <strong>Time is Expensive</strong> – Every round has a timer. If you hesitate too long, John grows angry.<br>🔹 <strong>Sign the Contract</strong> – Mark the correct phrase. A single mistake is enough to disappoint him, and disappointment always leads to punishment.<br>🔹 <strong>Hide if You Can</strong> – When Mama comes, you may run or hide, but you cannot truly escape her.<br>🔹 <strong>Endless Loops</strong> – Fail, and the cycle resets. You are forced to play again until you succeed or perish.<br>🔹 <strong>A Voice You Cannot Escape</strong> – John is always present. He mocks, jokes, guides, and toys with you through radios and whispers.<br>🔹 <strong>Two Endings</strong> – The story leads to a final decision, and your choice shapes how it all ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-Changing Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The anomalies shift. The rules may twist. John Ravenwood’s game adapts to you, <br>and he will do everything he can to keep you trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no simple way out. He does not only want your life. He wants to break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape. The only question is: can you outplay John Ravenwood and survive his manor?</p>",
