ng></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The anomalies shift. The rules may twist. John Ravenwood’s game adapts to you, <br>and he will do everything he can to keep you trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no simple way out. He does not only want your life. He wants to break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape. The only question is: can you outplay John Ravenwood and survive his manor?</p>",
